<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - November 8.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - November 8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse was at 2.3 million zlotys on Friday.</p>
<p>The following is a summary of the day's block transactions on the Warsaw bourse.</p>
<p>* 2,000 variable-interest 10-year bonds maturing on July 18, 2006 traded at 70.45 zlotys.</p>
<p>* 980 variable-interest 10-year bonds maturing on October 18, 2006 traded at 70.40 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
